OL,3,GNEWSAPolice name 43-year-old man killed
OL,4,Ain North Uist crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have named a man who died
OL,7,Ffollowing a two-car crash on the A867
OL,8,Fin North Uist.
OL,10,FThe crash happened at about 21:00 on
OL,11,FWednesday 30 September at Loch A'Bhruid
OL,12,Fand involved two vehicles, a black
OL,13,FMercedes A Class and a black Kia Ceed.
OL,15,FThomas Sharpe, 43, was taken to Queen
OL,16,FElizabeth Hospital in Glasgow where he
OL,17,Fdied a short time later.
OL,19,FA second man, aged 36, was taken to
OL,20,Fhospital in Benbecula.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
